//! The network Core API `steelcore.v1` (steelcore ADR-0001, ADR-0007).
//!
//! One TLS listener with mandatory client certificates serves two bindings of
//! the same contract (`proto/steelcore/v1`):
//!
//! * **gRPC** (HTTP/2, `content-type: application/grpc`), generated by tonic;
//! * **Connect-JSON** (HTTP/1.1 or HTTP/2, `POST /<package>.<Service>/<Method>`
//!   with `content-type: application/json`, proto3 JSON mapping), for clients
//!   that should not need a gRPC library.
//!
//! Both call the same [`service::CoreApi`] functions, which do admission
//! (certificate → access, scope, rate limit), idempotency and the write audit
//! and reach the data only through [`crate::core_api::profile::ProfileCore`].

pub mod access;
